WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:03.457
Unit twenty-one. Grief and Loss!

2
00:00:04.382 --> 00:00:09.125
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:12.151
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.201 --> 00:00:16.235
Today we learn about Grief and Loss. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.773 --> 00:00:21.073
Grief. Say it with me. Grief!

6
00:00:24.577 --> 00:00:28.127
Loss. Say it with me. Loss!

7
00:00:31.645 --> 00:00:36.278
Emotions. Say it with me. Emotions!

8
00:00:39.759 --> 00:00:43.676
Sadness. Say it with me. Sadness!

9
00:00:47.231 --> 00:00:50.914
Anger. Say it with me. Anger!

10
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:58.232
Support. Say it with me. Support!

11
00:01:01.723 --> 00:01:05.723
Remembering. Say it with me. Remembering!

12
00:01:09.171 --> 00:01:12.421
Time. Say it with me. Time!

13
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:26.927
Grief is a natural response to loss. It can bring sadness, anger, and many emotions. Support from others, remembering loved ones, and time help people heal.

14
00:01:26.977 --> 00:01:30.454
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:31.751 --> 00:01:36.887
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.937 --> 00:01:38.087
Emotions!

17
00:01:39.427 --> 00:01:45.037
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.087 --> 00:01:46.426
Remembering!

19
00:01:47.391 --> 00:01:53.244
Did you know? Grief has no fixed timetable — everyone grieves in their own way!

20
00:01:53.294 --> 00:01:55.666
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.663 --> 00:02:04.990
Think and answer. How can you support a friend who is grieving?

22
00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.190
Great answer!

23
00:02:07.121 --> 00:02:12.555
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:12.605 --> 00:02:15.333
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

